        "title": "Asking about age",
        "explanation_ar": "نسأل عن العمر بـ How old are you? ونجيب بـ I'm + الرقم. لا نحتاج كلمة years، ويمكن قول I'm seven years old.",
        "explanation_en": "Ask: How old are you? Answer: I'm + number. You can also say: I'm seven years old.",
        "examples": [
          "How old are you? - I'm seven.",
          "I'm three.",
          "I'm seven years old."
